  "details": "I wanted to go to the MUZZ-festival and when the world was initialising i was thrown back to the Steam-loading-world. VRC was ended. Clearing cache or even deinstalling VRC and Reinstalling did not help. But when i started VRC in flat-screen-mode i was able to enter MUZZ. (but i want to use VR of course) I had the same issue a few weeks ago with a clubworld which worked ok 3 months earlier and i was assuming that that map was not ok with one of the updates. But here the same happened and i've seen that a lot of people are in there and it is highlighted in the world-menu, so i guess it is a \"official\" VRC-approoved map. On the other hand my System is not so unusual: Valve Index, Win10 with current updates and enough power (2080TI, 12 cores and a lot of ram)\nIs there anyone else having this issue ? can i do something about it or what can be done ?",
